# -------------------- EMERGENCY SHELTER ---------------------

ShelterTemperatureSensor-->ShelterController@temperature
ShelterPowerSensor-->ShelterController@power
ShelterWaterSensor-->ShelterController@water

ShelterController-->ShelterGenerator@power
